<title>POLAND: PLI to transfer to main market Aug 7.</title>
<headline>PLI to transfer to main market Aug 7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesaler and retailer Polish Life  Improvement SA (PLI) will transfer to the main market from the bourse's  parallel floor on August 7, bourse deputy president Ryszard Czerniawski  told reporters on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
